The package installs headers under:
  include/keyhcommon

CMake usage:
  find_package(KeyhCommon CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(your-target PRIVATE KeyhCommon::KeyhCommon)

To link individual libraries instead:
  target_link_libraries(your-target PRIVATE
      KeyhCommon::CommonBase
      KeyhCommon::ReflectSystem
      KeyhCommon::AppSystem)

For MSBuild consumers using vcpkg integration, add the required libraries to
AdditionalDependencies:
  CommonBase.lib;ReflectSystem.lib;AppSystem.lib
